      <h2>Price Impact</h2>
      <p>Affiliate links do not increase the price you pay. In some cases, merchant tracking may qualify your purchase for a discount or loyalty program — this varies by merchant and is outside our control.</p>

      <h2>FTC Compliance</h2>
      <p>This disclosure is made in compliance with the Federal Trade Commission's guidelines on endorsements and testimonials (16 CFR Part 255) and its guidance on affiliate marketing disclosures. We take these obligations seriously. If you have questions about any specific link on the site, contact <a href="mailto:hello@stickvault.com" class="legal-link">hello@stickvault.com</a>.</p>

